          <msContents>
            <summary>Description of herbs, plants and other substances used in medicine, arranged according to qualities: in English. (Incomplete.) The sections on mineral and animal substances and the Indices are missing. This MS. is possibly an earlier text of MS. No. 340. The water-mark on the paper is similar, but has not been identified in Briquet. The last leaf contains a few medical receipts in English by an Elizabethan hand.</summary>
            <textLang mainLang="" source="IANA">English</textLang>
